    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4872" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμάλακ-τος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαλάσσω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>that cannot be softened, intractable,</i> of
			materials, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				385a13
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄτηκτα καὶ ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					388b25
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>unmitigated,</i>
			
