				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.953e
				</span></i>
			: metaph. of expression, <i>harsh,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Longin.
				15.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>unfeeling,</i> Sch.<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				776
			</span></i>.</div>
